The Sears keep an oracular device that forecasts the weather over [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. When a clear night turned into a downpour that would not stop, local diviners said the rain would hold until the Sears could work out what was wrong with the device, and then they would broadcast an updated prediction. Their device was still broken while the rain continued.
